<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="card intro-card">
    <view class="section-title">小程序足迹分布</view>
    <view class="muted">这一版先用“省份统计 + 景点列表”承接地图模块，方便在微信小程序里快速查看公共足迹和个人足迹。</view>
    <view class="toggle-row">
      <view class="mode-pill {{mine ? '' : 'active'}}" bindtap="switchScope" data-mine="false">公共足迹</view>
      <view class="mode-pill {{mine ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="switchScope" data-mine="true">个人足迹</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card province-card" wx:if="{{provinces.length > 0}}">
    <view class="section-title">省份分布</view>
    <view class="province-grid">
      <view class="province-chip {{selectedProvince === item.province ? 'selected' : ''}}" wx:for="{{provinces}}" wx:key="province" bindtap="selectProvince" data-province="{{item.province}}">
        {{item.province}} {{item.count}}
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card point-card">
    <view class="section-title">{{selectedProvince || '全部'}}景点</view>
    <view wx:for="{{visiblePoints}}" wx:key="postId" class="point-item" bindtap="openDetail" data-id="{{item.postId}}">
      <view class="point-title">{{item.location}}</view>
      <view class="muted">{{item.title}}</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{visiblePoints.length === 0}}" class="muted">这个范围里还没有足迹内容。</view>
  </view>
</view>
